Motion Graphics Toolkit (MGTK) @PROJECT_VERSION@
platform     : @MGTK_PLATFORM_OS@-@MGTK_PLATFORM_ARCH@
git revision : @MGTK_GIT_REVISION@
build type   : @CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE@
compiler     : @CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID@ @CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_VERSION@
ae sdk       : @AE_SDK_ROOT@
build flags  : @MGTK_BUILD_FLAGS@

Contents
--------
  plugins/       built @MGTK_AE_BUNDLE_SUFFIX@ bundles (one code fragment per effect)
  resources/pipl PiPL .r files -- attach with pipltool (Windows) or Rez
                 (macOS) before the bundle will load; see docs/BUILDING.md
  docs/          BUILDING.md, AEGP.md
  scripts/       install.sh, build_windows.bat

Install: copy plugins/* into the AE Plug-ins folder, then attach each
PiPL resource to its bundle. scripts/install.sh does both on macOS.
